mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Req[Automation request] --> Q1{Can a formula or validation rule meet it safely?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Decl[Stay on formula or validation]
  Q1 -->|No| Q2{Is it an approval chain?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Appr[Approval process; confirm classic vs Flow approvals in current Help]
  Q2 -->|No| Q3{Can Flow do it and can the owning team maintain it?}
  Q3 -->|Yes same record| Before[Before-save Flow]
  Q3 -->|Yes after DML or interaction| Flow[After-save, screen, or autolaunched Flow]
  Q3 -->|Flow cannot, or need a coded service/callout pattern| Apex[Apex: trigger, invocable, or async]
  Apex --> Q4{Synchronous callout from trigger?}
  Q4 -->|Yes attempted| Stop[Invalid: callout must be async from trigger context]
  Dup[Second Flow or trigger on same entry] --> Smell[Two cooks: consolidate]
